This restriction concerns monetizing the project or its derivatives. It does
not prohibit internal business use, the AI activities and resulting model
products permitted in section 3, or independent outputs merely because
they were produced with the software. Other applicable rights must still
be respected. Voluntary donations that are not a condition of access and
